        <mxCell id="l1WS8yBLob-7h8OTzgJN-11" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- ideally not make occurrences out of metabarcoding (if the infrastructure allows it eventually)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- with the current occurrence based index, occurrence ids have to be added to identification&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- tooling could suggest not creating occurrences for threshold read counts and certain taxonomy&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- sequences can be added to occurrences via material or events, or occurrences can be derived from sequences with a read count&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="290" width="440" x="760" y="840" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
